# Cloudflare Pages reads this file and serves these redirects on the deployed
# site, before it looks for a file on disk.
#
# The game is called Othello everywhere a visitor reads it, and the route is
# /reversi/ because that is the directory the build produces and the address
# already shared in links. So somebody who reasonably types the name they were
# shown should land on the game rather than on a 404 -- which is exactly what
# `not_found_handling: "404-page"` would otherwise give them.
#
# 301 rather than 302: this mapping is not going to change, and a permanent
# redirect lets search engines fold the two addresses into one entry instead of
# treating them as rival pages with identical content.
/othello    /reversi/    301
/othello/*  /reversi/    301
